In multiple intrusions, FIN13 deployed SIXPACK  and SWEARJAR . SIXPACK is an ASPX web shell written in C# that functions as a tunneler.
SIXPACK accepts HTTP form data that contains a remote host and TCP port to connect to, a timeout value, and Base64-encoded data to send after connecting to the specified host. Response data is read by SIXPACK and returned to the original client. SWEARJAR is a Java-based cross- platform backdoor that can execute shell commands.
